  "summary": "P-3's decline is most likely not caused by water but consistent with falling reservoir pressure. Its water cut has stayed at 1% with no breakthrough, while liquid and oil rates fell about 79% with the choke held open and bottom-hole pressure fell about 46%. The fit suggests a steady exponential decline after 2019.",
